 "Paprika, Mela, Mealie, Tandoor, Recipe Keeper, Crouton, MasterCook, Copy Me That, Cookmate, Living Cookbook, Evernote, Flavorish, CookBookManager, Plan to Eat en meer.": "Paprika, Mela, Mealie, Tandoor, Recipe Keeper, Crouton, MasterCook, Copy Me That, Cookmate, Living Cookbook, Evernote, Flavorish, CookBookManager, Plan to Eat et d'autres.",
 "Paprika, Mela, Mealie, Tandoor, Recipe Keeper, Crouton, MasterCook, Copy Me That, Cookmate, Living Cookbook, Evernote, Flavorish, CookBookManager, Plan to Eat en andere exports.": "Paprika, Mela, Mealie, Tandoor, Recipe Keeper, Crouton, MasterCook, Copy Me That, Cookmate, Living Cookbook, Evernote, Flavorish, CookBookManager, Plan to Eat et d'autres exports.",
